# With Today open in a second pane, giving a project a due date in the first pane adds it to the second pane's list at once, and closing the second pane leaves the outline.
file <<END
INBOX: @inbox
	- Renew passport @due({today-3})
Work:
	- Write quarterly report @due({today-2})
	- Review pull requests
END
keys gt <C-w> s
see │  󰖙 Today
keys g1 gh
see   󰋜
keys gg G k k T
see │  Work:
keys g2 <C-w> c
see ▌ Work:
hide │
quit
saved <<END
INBOX: @inbox
	- Renew passport @due({today-3})
Work: @due({today})
	- Write quarterly report @due({today-2})
	- Review pull requests
END
